+queue drops separately, bytes, logical batches, p50/p95 latency, packet and byte
+rates, CPU, requested/effective buffers, syscall counts, maximum successful
+datagram, fragmentation observation, and owned descriptor/task recovery. It
+never configures a VPN, route, DNS, interface, or NetworkExtension.
